(ned M24 -- rack ATC drawbar RELEASE, sensor-verified)
; The rack_atc_sim original was `M64 P2` (sim pin numbering). On ned the
; drawbar release is M64 P0 (e-stop gated via toolrel.permit,
; ned5_iron.hal:318-325) and MUST be verified: delegate to the ned
; unclamptool sub, which releases and waits for the S2 tool-released
; sensor (digital-in-01), aborting the whole tool change if the drawbar
; did not actually open.
o<m24> sub
(PRINT, o<m24> ned drawbar release + S2 verify)
o<unclamptool> call
o<m24> endsub [1]
M2
